/S /H2
/T (Resource Disparities: India faces the challenge of resource scarcity and the need for sustained financial aid. Addressing this, it's crucial to ensure a continuous resource supply to maintain economic growth within these nations.)
/E (Resource Disparities: India faces the challenge of resource scarcity and the need for sustained financial aid. Addressing this, it's crucial to ensure a continuous resource supply to maintain economic growth within these nations.)
