/T (Resource Divide: The Global South nations vary significantly in their economic status, technological progress, and natural resource endowments, leading to a complex resource divide. Their diverse priorities and interests further complicate India's role in representing their collective voice on the global stage.)
/E (Resource Divide: The Global South nations vary significantly in their economic status, technological progress, and natural resource endowments, leading to a complex resource divide. Their diverse priorities and interests further complicate India's role in representing their collective voice on the global stage.)
