/S /H2
/T (In this grand theatre of international relations, the rise of India and the challenge posed by China remind us that while the world may change, the age-old narratives of power, ambition, and influence continue to captivate our imagination and shape the course of history.)
/E (In this grand theatre of international relations, the rise of India and the challenge posed by China remind us that while the world may change, the age-old narratives of power, ambition, and influence continue to captivate our imagination and shape the course of history.)
